### Describe the problem

I created a transparent app that goes on top of other apps. It works well when the Tauri app is over other apps that are maximized, but not when the other apps are in fullscreen. I thought it was not possible until I saw "Screen Studio" app that is a transparent app on top of maximized or fullscreen apps.

### Describe the solution you'd like

Having a flag like alwaysOnTop to specify that it should include also on top of other fullscreen apps

### Alternatives considered

